        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-216, Seashell Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhether you live in San Diego or Key West, the shell cabinet knob is a great way to bring the beauty of the ocean indoors. The Seashell Knob is crafted with attention to detail that gives it a realistic look, but also an elegance one might not necessarily associate with beach themed decor. This cabinet knob made by RK International is available in polished brass (pictured), satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/seashell-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international-cp-413\"><b>CP-413 Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-216 Seashell Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
